Carrot cake
6
Carrot cake with cream cheese frosting, about 31 cm tin.

---
Cake
Flour|300|g
Sugar|150|g
Brown sugar|100|g
Baking powder|1|sachet
Cinnamon|1|tsp
Olive oil|18|cl
Grated carrots|500|g
Eggs|4|pcs
Salt|1|pinch
Walnuts|50|g

Frosting
Icing sugar|160|g
Cream cheese|120|g
Soft butter|120|g

---
Grate the carrots.
In a bowl, mix sugar, brown sugar, eggs, walnuts and carrots.
In a second bowl, mix flour, baking powder, salt and cinnamon. Fold into the first mixture.
Add the olive oil and mix.
Pour into a cake tin about 31 cm in diameter.
Bake 60 min at 180 °C. Set aside and let cool.

For the frosting: add the icing sugar to the cream cheese, then the soft butter. Mix. Add the rest of the cream cheese and whisk.
Spread the frosting over the cooled cake.

---
dessert
cake
carrot
frosting
